{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45842","headline":"东西二林寺流水 · 贯休","name":"东西二林寺流水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水尔何如此，区区矻矻流。\n墙墙边沥沥，砌砌下啾啾。\n味不卑於乳，声常占得秋。\n崩腾成大瀑，落托出深沟。\n远历神仙窟，高淋竹树头。\n数家舂碓磑，几处浴猿猴。\n共月穿峰罅，喧僧睡石楼。\n派通天宇阔，溜入楚江浮。\n爲润知何极，无边始自由。\n好归江海里，长负济川舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45842.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45842","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}